{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t06.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/t06.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "t06_01",
      "hash64": "136B7FCA250D62D9",
      "text": "这里是锦汇镇。\\n是不是很错综复杂？\\r\\n真是镇如其名啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "t06_10",
      "hash64": "136F04CA25107AAF",
      "text": "你去过宝食堂了？\\n听说道馆馆主是那里的常客！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "t06_18",
      "hash64": "136F0CCA25108847",
      "text": "本店的料理是帕底亚第一美味！\\n欢迎品尝！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "t06_19",
      "hash64": "136F0BCA25108694",
      "text": "顶新鲜餐厅！\\n菜肴富含矿物质哦～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "t06_22",
      "hash64": "136514CA2508415A",
      "text": "你的宝可梦应该是\\n想在本店进食吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "t06_31",
      "hash64": "136817CA250A7C4A",
      "text": "我听说高级餐厅\\n会有着装规定。\\r\\n到底会是什么样的规定呢……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "t06_32",
      "hash64": "136816CA250A7A97",
      "text": "我想存些零花钱，\\n让宝可梦吃好吃～的东西。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "t06_33",
      "hash64": "136815CA250A78E4",
      "text": "辛辣～的料理是本店的拿手菜！\\n来啊来啊，进来尝尝！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "t06_42",
      "hash64": "135E04CA2502077C",
      "text": "现在不需要预约\\n也能在本店用餐。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "t06_59",
      "hash64": "136183CA25051520",
      "text": "有个好～大的门挡道，\\n现在去不了帕底亚巨坑。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "t06_60",
      "hash64": "13577ACA24FCB150",
      "text": "听说在门的里面有个禁止入内，\\n叫做零区闸口的设施。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "t06_61",
      "hash64": "13577BCA24FCB303",
      "text": "锦汇镇知名的宝食堂\\n就是这里～！\\c\\n如果正在参加道馆测验，\\n还能点秘密菜单的菜哦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "t06_65",
      "hash64": "13577FCA24FCB9CF",
      "text": "我听说在宝食堂\\n能改变太晶属性。\\r\\n但大厨却让我吃了闭门羹……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "t06_79",
      "hash64": "135A87CA24FEFD3E",
      "text": "来个三明治如何？\\n就算肚子还没饿也欢迎品尝～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "t06_101",
      "hash64": "161FC17CFB005A7A",
      "text": "我要在爬霜抹山之前，\\n先在锦汇镇的商业街吃饭，\\r\\n让身体充满活力。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "t06_106",
      "hash64": "161FBC7CFB0051FB",
      "text": "这个城镇成了\\n帕底亚的交通要地。\\c\\n从外地来的人很多，\\n所以餐厅自然也变多了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "t06_107",
      "hash64": "161FBB7CFB005048",
      "text": "我的藏饱栗鼠\\n最近变得越来越大……\\r\\n要不要搬去有大房间的家呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "t06_109",
      "hash64": "161FB97CFB004CE2",
      "text": "去霜抹山的路途很艰险！\\n要去的话，就要做好准备啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "t06_115",
      "hash64": "161C397CFAFD3D8B",
      "text": "这个城镇没有对战场。\\n在哪里和道馆馆主对战呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "t06_117",
      "hash64": "161C3B7CFAFD40F1",
      "text": "在很久以前，这个楼梯下面是座剧院。\\n那时会举办戏剧演出和音乐会哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "t06_133",
      "hash64": "1623277CFB033DA3",
      "text": "年轻人，你是学生吗？\\n看来现在是课外活动的季节啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    }
  ]
}
